<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>Microsoft.VisualBasic.MIME.text.yaml</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>Microsoft.VisualBasic.MIME.text.yaml</AssemblyName>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <Platforms>AnyCPU;x64</Platforms>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;LipidSearch;Rsharp_app_release;mzkit;gcmodeller_desktop;nuget_release</Configurations>
    <AutoGenerateBindingRedirects>true</AutoGenerateBindingRedirects>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageProjectUrl>http://scibasic.net/</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/xieguigang/sciBASIC</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <UseApplicationFramework>True</UseApplicationFramework>
    <AssemblyTitle>Microsoft.VisualBasic.MIME.text.yaml</AssemblyTitle>
    <Version>1.0.9762.10518</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.0.9762.10518</AssemblyVersion>
    <Title>YAML to JSON Object Model Parser and Front Matter Reader</Title>
    <Description>Parses YAML for the sciBASIC# framework into the JsonElement model with block mappings, sequences, flow collections, block scalars, anchors, aliases and comments, plus a lightweight markdown front-matter reader and typed deserialization helpers.</Description>
    <Authors>xieguigang &lt;I@xieguigang.me&gt;</Authors>
    <Company>sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Company>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Copyright>
    <PackageTags>scibasic;yaml;yaml-parser;front-matter;json;configuration;deserialization</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>The YAML reader of sciBASIC#. It turns YAML text into the shared JsonElement model from Microsoft.VisualBasic.MIME.application.json, so YAML and JSON documents share one object model. Parsing: YamlParser.Parse handles YAML text while YamlParser.ParseFile reads a file; block mappings, block sequences and nested structures are supported, and a pre-processing pass (YamlLine, MultiLineState) handles flow collections, block scalars with | or &gt; style and +/- chomping indicators, and multi line quoted scalars. YAML features: anchors (&amp;name), aliases (*name) and merge keys (&lt;&lt;: *name) are resolved through a per parser anchor table, comments are stripped outside quoted strings, and scalar types are inferred automatically. Deserialization: the Serialization module provides LoadYAML and LoadYAMLDocument that map a YAML file or string straight onto a .NET class. Front matter: YamlFrontMatterParser.Parse extracts the --- delimited front matter block at the top of a document into a dictionary, and StripFrontMatter returns the body only - useful for static site generators and markdown tooling.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>GPL-3.0-or-later</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageIcon>logo-knot.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='nuget_release|x64'">
    <PlatformTarget>x64</PlatformTarget>
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>true</RemoveIntegerChecks>
    <DebugSymbols>true</DebugSymbols>
    <DebugType>full</DebugType>
    <OutputPath>../../.nuget/</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="test\**" />
    <EmbeddedResource Remove="test\**" />
    <None Remove="test\**" />
    <None Include="..\..\vs_solutions\logo-knot.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Microsoft.VisualBasic.Core\src\Core.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\application%json\JSON-netcore5.vbproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
  </Project> 